 ('c0789','towers-review','The tower’s economic distinction from the retained Bat Hardin national system is unresolved.','NIT-funded no-work residents and paid service staff repeat the known national mechanism; a different building or crime plot alone does not create a second society.'),
 ('c0790','commune','The commune model’s distinctness from the retained national Bat Hardin economy is unresolved.','Actual automatic support is clear, but leisure associations supported by the same national floor require a material control/access difference before another point is counted.'),
